{"title":"Career Roadmap · Ayurvedic Product Consultant","role":"Ayurvedic Product Consultant","summary":"An Ayurvedic Product Consultant combines knowledge of Ayurvedic medicine, medicinal plants, formulations, product development, quality, regulatory requirements, consumer education, and the Ayurvedic wellness market.","facts":{"Current degree":"BAMS (Ayurveda)","Course":"Ayurvedic Medicine & Surgery"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Ayurvedic Product Consultant combines knowledge of Ayurvedic medicine, medicinal plants, formulations, product development, quality, regulatory requirements, consumer education, and the Ayurvedic wellness market."},{"type":"h","text":"The role may involve:"},{"type":"h","text":"Advising organizations on Ayurvedic product portfolios"},{"type":"h","text":"Supporting Ayurvedic formulation development"},{"type":"h","text":"Understanding herbs and classical ingredients"},{"type":"h","text":"Evaluating product concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Supporting product documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Assisting R&D teams"},{"type":"h","text":"Reviewing ingredient and formulation information"},{"type":"h","text":"Supporting quality and regulatory teams"},{"type":"h","text":"Training sales and marketing teams on product knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"Providing evidence-based product education"},{"type":"h","text":"Supporting product launches"},{"type":"h","text":"Conducting competitor and market research"},{"type":"h","text":"Working with manufacturers, pharmacies, wellness brands and healthcare companies"},{"type":"p","text":"The role is particularly suitable for a BAMS graduate who wants to combine Ayurvedic clinical knowledge with product, business, R&D and regulatory work."},{"type":"note","label":"Professional scope","text":"BAMS is a professional Ayurvedic medical qualification. Product consulting does not automatically authorize a person to make claims, manufacture medicines, prescribe outside applicable scope, or perform regulatory functions reserved for appropriately qualified/authorized professionals. Product roles should distinguish medical advice, product information, wellness communication and regulatory claims."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Class 12 — PCB"},{"type":"h","text":"BAMS"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical + Ayurvedic Medicine Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Product / R&D / Quality / Regulatory Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Product Executive / Ayurvedic Product Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic Product Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Product Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Manager / Ayurvedic R&D Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory / Product Strategy Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head – Ayurvedic Products / R&D / Product Strategy"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"BAMS"},{"type":"h","text":"M.D. Ayurveda / PG Specialization"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic R&D / Product Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Product Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Strategy / R&D Leadership"}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During BAMS","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BAMS provides the medical and Ayurvedic foundation required to understand products scientifically and traditionally."},{"type":"h","text":"Foundational Sciences"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Biochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology-related concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Microbiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic clinical sciences"}]},{"heading":"Ayurvedic Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Develop strong understanding of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurveda philosophy"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic principles of Ayurveda"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosha concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Dhatu"},{"type":"h","text":"Mala"},{"type":"h","text":"Agni"},{"type":"h","text":"Prakriti"},{"type":"h","text":"Vikriti"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic diagnostic principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive health"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle and dietary principles"},{"type":"p","text":"The product consultant should be able to translate these concepts into accurate and responsible product communication."}]},{"heading":"Dravyaguna Vigyana","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly important for Ayurvedic product careers."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicinal plants"},{"type":"h","text":"Botanical identification"},{"type":"h","text":"Plant parts used"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic properties"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacological actions"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional indications"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Toxicity awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Herb-drug interactions"},{"type":"h","text":"Collection and storage"},{"type":"h","text":"Product-oriented understanding"},{"type":"p","text":"For every important ingredient, understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient"},{"type":"h","text":"Botanical Identity"},{"type":"h","text":"Part Used"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic Properties"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional Use"},{"type":"h","text":"Active Constituents"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation Compatibility"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Application"}]},{"heading":"Rasashastra & Bhaishajya Kalpana","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These areas are highly relevant to product development."},{"type":"h","text":"Students should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic dosage forms"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Processing methods"},{"type":"h","text":"Raw materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Classical formulations"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage"},{"type":"h","text":"Stability"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging"},{"type":"p","text":"Product consultants should understand the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Classical formulations"},{"type":"h","text":"Proprietary Ayurvedic formulations"},{"type":"h","text":"Herbal wellness products"},{"type":"h","text":"Food/nutraceutical-type products"},{"type":"h","text":"Cosmetic products"},{"type":"p","text":"Their regulatory and permissible claims can differ substantially."}]},{"heading":"Clinical Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Clinical exposure helps the consultant understand actual healthcare needs."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Kayachikitsa"},{"type":"h","text":"Shalya"},{"type":"h","text":"Shalakya"},{"type":"h","text":"Kaumarabhritya"},{"type":"h","text":"Prasuti & Stri Roga"},{"type":"h","text":"Panchakarma"},{"type":"h","text":"Swasthavritta"},{"type":"h","text":"Roganidana"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency/modern medical fundamentals as covered in the curriculum"},{"type":"p","text":"This enables better communication between:"},{"type":"h","text":"clinical teams ↔ product teams ↔ R&D ↔ regulatory teams ↔ consumers"}]},{"heading":"Product Development Lifecycle","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Ayurvedic Product Consultant should understand the complete lifecycle."},{"type":"h","text":"Market / Consumer Need"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient Selection"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature & Evidence Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Prototype"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety / Quality Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Stability Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging & Labelling"},{"type":"h","text":"Market Launch"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer Feedback"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-Market Monitoring"}]},{"heading":"Product Concept Development","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A consultant may help identify opportunities such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Digestive wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"General lifestyle wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Stress-management products"},{"type":"h","text":"Skin-care products"},{"type":"h","text":"Hair-care products"},{"type":"h","text":"Women's wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Sports/recovery wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Sleep and relaxation"},{"type":"h","text":"Immunity-support products"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional herbal formulations"},{"type":"p","text":"The consultant should avoid turning a market trend into an unsupported medical claim."}]},{"heading":"Ayurvedic Ingredient Research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong product consultant should be able to evaluate an ingredient from multiple perspectives."},{"type":"table","header":["Dimension","Questions"],"rows":[[{"text":"Identity"},{"text":"Is the plant correctly identified?"}],[{"text":"Traditional use"},{"text":"What is its Ayurvedic application?"}],[{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"What scientific evidence exists?"}],[{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"What are known risks?"}],[{"text":"Dosage"},{"text":"What is appropriate within the applicable formulation?"}],[{"text":"Interactions"},{"text":"Could it interact with medicines?"}],[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Is the raw material authentic?"}],[{"text":"Contamination"},{"text":"Are there adulteration risks?"}],[{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"Is sourcing responsible?"}],[{"text":"Regulation"},{"text":"What product category does it fall under?"}]]}]},{"heading":"Evidence-Based Product Evaluation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern Ayurvedic product development benefits from combining:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic Classical Knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacognosy"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Phytochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Modern Scientific Literature"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety Data"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Responsible Product Development"},{"type":"h","text":"A consultant should distinguish between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional use"},{"type":"h","text":"Preclinical evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Observational evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Strong clinical evidence"},{"type":"p","text":"These should never be presented as equivalent."}]},{"heading":"Quality Control Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Product consultants should understand the basics of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Raw-material authentication"},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier qualification"},{"type":"h","text":"Standardization"},{"type":"h","text":"Contamination control"},{"type":"h","text":"Microbial testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Heavy-metal testing where applicable"},{"type":"h","text":"Pesticide residue considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Adulteration detection"},{"type":"h","text":"Batch consistency"},{"type":"h","text":"Stability"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging integrity"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Raw Material"},{"type":"h","text":"Authentication"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Approved Supplier"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"h","text":"In-process Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Finished Product Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Batch Release"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage"},{"type":"h","text":"Distribution"},{"type":"p","text":"The actual testing and release process must be performed by appropriately qualified quality professionals under the applicable regulatory framework."}]},{"heading":"Regulatory & Compliance Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important differentiators for an Ayurvedic Product Consultant."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic drug regulation"},{"type":"h","text":"Product classification"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Labelling requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Advertising/claims principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality standards"},{"type":"h","text":"Licensing concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacopoeial standards"},{"type":"h","text":"GMP concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer protection"},{"type":"h","text":"Product safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Import/export considerations where relevant"},{"type":"p","text":"The exact requirements depend on the product category, formulation, manufacturer, claims and jurisdiction."}]},{"heading":"Product Claims","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the consultant's most important responsibilities is helping ensure that product communication remains appropriate."},{"type":"h","text":"Avoid unsupported claims such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Guaranteed cure\""},{"type":"h","text":"\"100% treatment\""},{"type":"h","text":"\"No side effects\""},{"type":"h","text":"\"Clinically proven\" without appropriate evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Replaces prescribed medication\""},{"type":"h","text":"Better approach"},{"type":"h","text":"Separate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional Use"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Approved / Permitted Claims"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"A product consultant should coordinate with regulatory/legal teams before finalizing claims."}]},{"heading":"Packaging & Labelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Understand product information such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient declaration"},{"type":"h","text":"Directions for use"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage conditions"},{"type":"h","text":"Batch information"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing details"},{"type":"h","text":"Expiry/shelf-life"},{"type":"h","text":"Warnings"},{"type":"h","text":"Applicable statutory declarations"},{"type":"h","text":"Usage limitations"},{"type":"p","text":"Packaging should communicate the product accurately without misleading consumers."}]},{"heading":"Product Portfolio Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An experienced consultant may manage several products."},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"table","header":["Product","Consumer Segment","Product Type","Key Consideration"],"rows":[[{"text":"Herbal digestive formulation"},{"text":"Adults"},{"text":"Ayurvedic product"},{"text":"Evidence + safety"}],[{"text":"Herbal hair-care product"},{"text":"Consumers"},{"text":"Cosmetic/wellness"},{"text":"Cosmetic claims"}],[{"text":"Stress-support formulation"},{"text":"Adults"},{"text":"Wellness/Ayurvedic"},{"text":"Claim substantiation"}],[{"text":"Herbal skin product"},{"text":"Consumers"},{"text":"Cosmetic"},{"text":"Ingredient safety"}],[{"text":"Traditional formulation"},{"text":"Specific users"},{"text":"Ayurvedic medicine"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"}]]}]},{"heading":"Market Research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A product consultant should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer needs"},{"type":"h","text":"Competitor products"},{"type":"h","text":"Pricing"},{"type":"h","text":"Distribution"},{"type":"h","text":"Product reviews"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer complaints"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient trends"},{"type":"h","text":"Market positioning"},{"type":"h","text":"Product differentiation"},{"type":"h","text":"Product-market workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Market Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Competitor Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient / Formulation Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Feasibility"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Development"}]},{"heading":"Consumer & Healthcare Professional Education","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A consultant may train:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales teams"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacists"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness consultants"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer-support teams"},{"type":"h","text":"Distributors"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare professionals"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand teams"},{"type":"h","text":"Training should cover:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product ingredients"},{"type":"h","text":"Intended use"},{"type":"h","text":"Appropriate communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Usage instructions"},{"type":"h","text":"Contraindication/safety information"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory boundaries"}]},{"heading":"Product Documentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong documentation skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Important documents may include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product specification"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient dossier"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature review"},{"type":"h","text":"Product-development brief"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation rationale"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Stability information"},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality specifications"},{"type":"h","text":"Product training manual"},{"type":"h","text":"FAQ"},{"type":"h","text":"Product comparison sheet"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory checklist"}]},{"heading":"Technology Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Ayurvedic Product Consultant does not need to become a software engineer, but modern product roles benefit from technology literacy."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"PowerPoint"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Google Sheets"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Product-management tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific databases"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature-search platforms"},{"type":"h","text":"Data skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Survey analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Market segmentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Product performance analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard development"}]},{"heading":"AI in Ayurvedic Product Development","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI can support:"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature discovery"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient research"},{"type":"h","text":"Competitor analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer sentiment analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Product-market research"},{"type":"h","text":"Document summarization"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory-document organization"},{"type":"h","text":"Knowledge management"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation research support"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific / Ayurvedic Literature"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Information Extraction"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Expert Verification"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence Classification"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Development Decision"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Review"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated scientific or regulatory information must be independently verified against authoritative sources."}]},{"heading":"Projects During BAMS","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Ayurvedic Ingredient Database"},{"type":"h","text":"Create a database containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sanskrit name"},{"type":"h","text":"Common name"},{"type":"h","text":"Botanical name"},{"type":"h","text":"Part used"},{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic properties"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional applications"},{"type":"h","text":"Active constituents"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Product applications"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Product Competitor Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Compare 10–20 products on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredients"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosage form"},{"type":"h","text":"Price"},{"type":"h","text":"Claims"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Target audience"},{"type":"h","text":"Distribution"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer reviews"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Ayurvedic Product Dossier"},{"type":"h","text":"Prepare a simulated dossier containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Target consumer"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredient rationale"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Herbal Evidence Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Select an Ayurvedic ingredient and evaluate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacological Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Preclinical Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence Gap"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Product Launch Strategy"},{"type":"h","text":"Create a launch plan covering:"},{"type":"h","text":"Target audience"},{"type":"h","text":"Positioning"},{"type":"h","text":"Product differentiation"},{"type":"h","text":"Distribution"},{"type":"h","text":"Pricing"},{"type":"h","text":"Educational content"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory-safe claims"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital marketing"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-launch monitoring"}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Prioritize internships in:"},{"type":"table","header":["Organization","Exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Ayurvedic pharmaceutical company"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Ayurvedic R&D centre"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Herbal product manufacturer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Quality-control laboratory"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Regulatory affairs department"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Ayurvedic hospital"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Herbal cosmetics company"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Nutraceutical company"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Consumer wellness company"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Clinical research organization"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Pharmacognosy research lab"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Product-management team"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"A good progression is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 → Clinical + Ayurvedic Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 → Pharmacognosy / Formulation Exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 → R&D / Quality Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 → Product / Regulatory Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year → Ayurvedic Product Development Project"}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Ayurvedic medicine knowledge"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Dravyaguna"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Ayurvedic formulations"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Pharmacognosy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Quality awareness"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Regulatory awareness"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Scientific literature review"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Clinical understanding"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Consumer education"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"AI literacy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Business understanding"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Ayurvedic / Scientific"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacognosy"},{"type":"h","text":"Herbal